sequenceDiagram
    participant U1 as User 1
    participant S1 as Server 1
    participant R as Redis
    participant S2 as Server 2
    participant U2 as User 2

    U1->>S1: Connect to websocket
    U2->>S2: Connect to websocket

    S1->>R: SUBSCRIBE room:lobby
    S2->>R: SUBSCRIBE room:lobby

    U1->>S1: Send message "Hello everyone"
    S1->>R: PUBLISH room:lobby "User 1: Hello everyone"
    R->>S1: Message
    R->>S2: Message
    S2->>U2: Forward message via websocket

    U2->>S2: Send message "Hi there"
    S2->>R: PUBLISH room:lobby "User 2: Hi there"
    R->>S1: Message
    R->>S2: Message
    S1->>U1: Forward message via websocket